{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，美國國會下屬的美中經濟與安全審查委員會在年度報告中稱，中國軍方正試圖繞過美國的出口管制，獲取英偉達等公司生產的先進晶片，以推動人工智能在武器和軍事系統中的應用。報告認為，儘管美國持續收緊對華晶片出口，中國仍將先進半導體視為發展「智能化戰爭」能力的關鍵資源。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587100.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.365000+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:03:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558908+00:00","content_hash":"1838b2c377b31ea1a678a652fbd81c1507115e46434194e496bd3f43755b8a03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}